{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a scientist paying for the mistakes you tried to bury. To understand what you\u2019ve done, you must hold on to your sanity though perhaps madness itself is the only path to truth. What you see and hear changes with your mind, and your fate will depend on how well you can hold it together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Way of Madness</strong></i><strong> is a fully hand-drawn 2D survival horror game. Every frame is illustrated by hand, pulling you into a world where strange beauty hides grotesque enemies, scarce resources, and choices that twist your story. Survive the hallucinations, confront the horrors you\u2019ve created, and decide whether your mind is worth saving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866230/extras/2fd56f64cabc89b92cc48bfa1f6cb7d4.avif?t=1757793557\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866230/extras/04b6799ac214966e52741d0377ec2fe0.avif?t=1757793557\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866230/extras/849c9b9f4efe000951b17a78197eeacd.poster.avif?t=1757793557\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866230/extras/849c9b9f4efe000951b17a78197eeacd.webm?t=1757793557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866230/extras/849c9b9f4efe000951b17a78197eeac